    <div class="modal-body">
   <p><strong>PRISM</strong> is an advanced Open Source Intelligence (OSINT) automation platform designed to streamline and enhance digital investigations.</p>

   <p>With over 200 integrated data sources and a modern, intuitive interface, PRISM makes complex intelligence gathering simple and efficient for investigators, researchers, and security professionals.</p>

   <p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
   <ul>
     <li>200+ OSINT modules and data sources</li>
     <li>Modern purple gradient UI with dark mode</li>
     <li>Multiple export formats (CSV, Excel, JSON, GEXF)</li>
     <li>Intelligent correlation engine</li>
     <li>RESTful API support</li>
   </ul>

   <p><strong>Developed by:</strong><br>
   Yash Patil • Soumitra Bapat • Sharvari Jadhav</p>

